# Claude Code
CLAUDE.md

# Photo/video masters. These are the camera originals that feed
# `npm run optimize:images` and scripts/encode-video.sh — hundreds of MB that
# would sit in git history forever. The web renditions under public/media/ are
# tracked instead, since those are what actually deploys. Keep the masters
# backed up somewhere outside the repo.
src/assets/_originals/
